 "notes": {
  "forAnalyst": "The payment options a business can offer without a gateway integration — cash on delivery, invoice, manual capture.",
  "forArchitect": "The reference Payment adapter, and the one that proves the port: one entity, six migrations, and methods that complete without an external call. Often the only payment module a B2B solution needs.",
  "forDeveloper": "Read this module before writing a gateway integration — it is the smallest complete example of the Payment abstraction.",
